  its mandatory repl argument — signature becomes {query, repl? |
  theory?, max_results?}, the same context selectors find_definition
  already specs (repl = that repl's goal-aware context, theory =
  loaded/image global context normalized per the theory-name spelling
  rule, default = base image). rationale: the search needs a context,
  not proof state; this was the one repl-bound tool left in the
