  kind?, prefix?} are recorded as flagged-but-NOT-implemented tool
  aliases over the isabelle://theory/{name} and .../entities backends,
  the escape hatch if a target mcp client cannot read resources
  (tools are model-callable everywhere; resources are often
  client-mediated). deliberately not built: known clients read
  resources, and mirrors duplicate the surface the model chooses
  from. sketches in plans/read_theory and plans/list_entities;
  revisit trigger = an evals/ failure reaching theory content.

